  "bio": "Alina is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Moscow, Russia, specializing in intricate dotwork designs. Her ability to bring bold and daring ideas to life, from delicate to robust tattoos, is showcased through proficient freehand and hand poke techniques. Clients visiting her home studio are not only impressed by her artistic expertise but also by the pristine cleanliness maintained throughout the tattoo process, ensuring a safe and comfortable experience for every individual.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Moscow, Central Federal District, Russia"
